[S6T5].\n- On 2023-05-03, said he's stuck with his music — \"like [his] creativity's frozen\" — and asked Dave for tips; said he'll take Dave's advice (take a break from music and explore other things for fun) to get his \"mojo\" back, and affirmed he won't give up on his music [S5T10][S5T11][S5T12][S5T14].\n- On 2023-05-16, \"super excited\" for the Tokyo performance happening this month (May 2023) — a chance to show his music to a whole new crowd and hopefully expand his following (details in ## Tokyo trip) [S6T11]. The tour went ahead: as of 2023-05-31 he had been touring with Frank Ocean the week before (see ## Tokyo trip) [S7T1].\n- As of 2023-06-09, has an album in progress (\"my album\"); met with the creative team for it on 2023-06-08 — \"a long session, but awesome to see everything coming together\", and he's \"feeling stoked\" and \"making some magic\" in the studio working on the music and everything. He shared a photo of the studio (a recording studio with a large window and a desk) [S8T1][S8T3].","text_sha256":"4e8cea7e08c7aced043a9de0d9480a3a01af4e934a35335f2d43ae03f86b0ad9","timestamp":null},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D3:1","D3:3"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":52,"line_start":52,"source_locators":["[S3T1]","[S3T3]"],"text_sha256":"22c5fe899b94f9955ebba8eac818e1581efa09a994a4a4035d81631a1b8b86ee"},{"dia_ids":["D3:5"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":53,"line_start":53,"source_locators":["[S3T5]"],"text_sha256":"83b67223376640e828b20aba4ccde8ab40060ff72a5ca822bb528232ea4d6cee"},{"dia_ids":["D3:7"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":54,"line_start":54,"source_locators":["[S3T7]"],"text_sha256":"9a26ad32cdf3b0eda773e0ca7cc00de84c8804315d9dcd379cc02fb5feda823b"},{"dia_ids":["D6:13","D6:14","D6:15","D6:16","D6:17"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":55,"line_start":55,"source_locators":["[S6T13]","[S6T14]","[S6T15]","[S6T16]","[S6T17]"],"text_sha256":"565e