l he called \"awesome\" — no bands, but met lots of talented artists and industry people, which he found totally enriching [S3T1][S3T3].\n- Learned a lot and got great advice from professionals in the music industry; found it inspiring [S3T5].\n- A producer advised him to stay true to himself and sound unique; it made him think about where he wants his music to go and is motivating him [S3T7].\n- On 2023-05-16, still in Tokyo: shared a photo of the Tokyo night skyline taken \"last night\" (2023-05-15) — \"the skyline was stunning\"; Dave praised the shot and said he has to take a trip to Tokyo soon [S6T13][S6T14][S6T15][S6T16]. Calvin thanked Dave and said the city lights in Tokyo are amazing, encouraging Dave to visit — \"it's awesome!\" [S6T17].\n- As of 2023-05-16, he has an upcoming performance in Tokyo \"this month\" (May 2023) he is \"super excited\" for — great to show his music to a whole new crowd and hopefully expand his following [S6T11].","text_sha256":"4f8da0508c9d2fe19bef56535ba49c558fa8aa6ffd5b2964d03a08673ad84b5e","timestamp":null},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D2:2","D2:6","D2:16"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":174,"line_start":174,"source_locators":["[S2T2]","[S2T6]","[S2T16]"],"text_sha256":"732b84e76b1cc79c223870ec93c624f2fea908c0454a63a5d267ca4eca08360c"},{"dia_ids":["D2:18","D2:20"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":175,"line_start":175,"source_locators":["[S2T18]","[S2T20]"],"text_sha256":"83fe522d7e24f21c1c534317e0330f8375c5a05d1a5c248432d436e001348b61"},{"dia_ids":["D3:1","D3:2","D3:4","D3:6","D3:8"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":176,"line_start":176,"source_locators":["[S3T1]","[S3T2]","[S3T4]","[S3T6]","[S3T8]"],"text_sha256":"db995bf64126919324353308c2a7ae7d899c6f4d8851979b839439f21021c5c2"},{"dia_ids":["D7:1","D7:2","D7:4","D7:5","D7:6","D7:7","D7:8","D7:9","D7:10","D7:11","D7:12","D7:13","D7:14","D7:15","D7:16","D7:17","D7:18","D7:19"